# What git never tracks here. The repository checks read this file too, so the
# prose scan covers exactly the files git would track. They understand only
# single segment patterns, optionally anchored with a leading slash or limited to
# directories with a trailing slash; anything else fails the checks rather than
# being guessed at.

# Editor and IDE state: each developer's own, never shared.
.idea/
.vscode/
*.swp
*~

# Operating system clutter.
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db
desktop.ini

# Build output. go build ./cmd/the-front-buttons writes the binary at the root.
/the-front-buttons
/the-front-buttons.exe
/bin/
/dist/

# Debugger builds left by Delve, which GoLand and VS Code both run.
__debug_bin*

# Test, coverage and profiling output.
*.test
*.out
*.prof
coverage.html

# Logs from running the daemon out of a checkout.
*.log
